{"id": "official:sentence:abd82a45-1115-46b9-bbbb-7effe200fce4", "text": "他正在思考这个难题。", "shortMeaning": "他正琢磨这道难题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64901225-97b3-4705-9f57-7cd45a0c7878", "text": "他正睡着，像个婴儿一样。", "shortMeaning": "他睡得像个娃娃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f23d42f7-a582-4d61-a2f1-3a9ed5425385", "text": "他正遭受严重头痛的困扰。", "shortMeaning": "他正被厉害的头痛缠着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f079e9fe-efdd-449e-9d18-8fb6ace45601", "text": "他母亲的离世带给他悲伤和遗憾。", "shortMeaning": "母亲走了，他心里又悲又憾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b9df2619-fac2-4308-a8d9-3292b86af49f", "text": "他每个月挣50万日元。", "shortMeaning": "他一个月挣五十万日元。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e79d42d-288d-49c3-88e5-d7907fdcf257", "text": "他每周打三次网球。", "shortMeaning": "他一周打三回网球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38bf132c-7b34-4a78-8312-4d9999a39539", "text": "他每天去河里游泳。", "shortMeaning": "他天天到河里去游。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c0b3a1b-c588-4ef5-ac7c-f57c60f92c16", "text": "他每天早上八点起床。", "shortMeaning": "他清早八点起身。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:532bef54-531f-4003-9f65-a4afc0b34bbe", "text": "他每天早上去公园。", "shortMeaning": "他清早都往公园去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:341a6a3f-3cc1-4839-ba76-29e04fb7c733", "text": "他每天早晨8点起床。", "shortMeaning": "他每天早晨八点钟起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:508b067e-6cd2-45bd-a9ef-9eb06ab48c8b", "text": "他每天晚上出去喝酒。", "shortMeaning": "他夜夜出门喝酒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3bd833fe-735c-4f6e-8f1f-d66c8fa24453", "text": "他每天祈祷好几次。", "shortMeaning": "他一天要祷告几回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:241c688f-67be-408d-99cd-faf6b8ed4219", "text": "他每天让我工作十多个小时。", "shortMeaning": "他每天叫我干十个多钟头的活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:869d4ba7-7722-410a-ac51-ff457100cfa6", "text": "他每天都在公园中跑步。", "shortMeaning": "他天天在公园里跑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b85f97a8-4934-4e56-af12-80953600dd38", "text": "他每天都给她打电话。", "shortMeaning": "他天天给她去电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22abaff8-061d-4cba-90b9-94f268b625d4", "text": "他每年冬天在北海道滑雪。", "shortMeaning": "每年冬天他去北海道滑雪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aef5d68c-8e2d-49e9-8bba-a33ff56c6a58", "text": "他每次逃跑都回到这个地区。", "shortMeaning": "他每回跑了都回到这一带。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2ec66a2-c433-48bc-878e-2f6387468797", "text": "他比我高出一个头。", "shortMeaning": "他比我高一个头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b42c405-c9ce-46b6-b603-b5bf53ddc108", "text": "他比较了复印稿和原件。", "shortMeaning": "他把复印件跟原件对过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22aa4425-7478-481c-86b5-8d9945a34118", "text": "他比镇里的其他人都有钱。", "shortMeaning": "镇上数他有钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8fa9642e-4e83-4692-a43d-8d51b4646567", "text": "他比队里的任何一个人都优秀。", "shortMeaning": "队里没一个比得上他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a469229a-9359-4a81-a996-c929eaf5ce5d", "text": "他毕业以后会更成熟的。", "shortMeaning": "毕业之后他会老成些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db6be544-d5a5-462d-8171-acf85f5f20ea", "text": "他毕竟是那个时代的人。", "shortMeaning": "他终究是那个年头的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca447ebf-6b68-4839-8e3f-55acc68bb21c", "text": "他毫不犹豫地把自己的车卖了。", "shortMeaning": "他一点没犹豫就把车卖了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:781ae2a4-054f-4364-82f2-588d92ad424b", "text": "他毫不犹豫地撒了谎。", "shortMeaning": "他张口就撒了个谎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07602bbf-987e-426c-b0f2-c95651098ebe", "text": "他毫无困难就找到了位子。", "shortMeaning": "他没费劲就找着了座位。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:045a1950-78b9-4f99-8b0b-24d17046e4a0", "text": "他气势汹汹地冲进了房间。", "shortMeaning": "他火气冲天地闯进屋来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7ffe6bd-0d2c-4d2a-bd05-16f6b2ac1a4c", "text": "他气得说不出话来了。", "shortMeaning": "他气得讲不出话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b8b86dd-dca5-4206-8f29-ebe2ec506650", "text": "他永远不会打败我的。", "shortMeaning": "他休想赢我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c71f0364-b333-445f-af2a-dcdc86951c22", "text": "他永远发现不了真相。", "shortMeaning": "真相他永远查不出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6652092c-c437-4017-9b5d-9c3a00ee7b45", "text": "他求我尽力去帮他搭桥拉线。", "shortMeaning": "他求我尽力给他牵线。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ef7710e-e43e-4b6d-8009-5d9e47da2987", "text": "他汉字写得非常好。", "shortMeaning": "他汉字写得极漂亮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b4b0b71a-e143-47cc-9938-8ed76f6e8508", "text": "他沉浸在阅读之中。", "shortMeaning": "他读得入了神。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77de37d4-ac18-40ce-aa70-f044f3e4d5e4", "text": "他沉迷于探讨科技惊悚题材的影视作品，认为这些故事揭示了未来的潜在威胁。", "shortMeaning": "他迷科技惊悚片，觉得那些故事讲出了将来的隐患。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3efa4fbf-256b-44ed-b565-8e6ebce49591", "text": "他沉迷于语言学的研究。", "shortMeaning": "他一头扎进语言学里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ba54fb1-c051-4e08-8c45-0c9b85b3578e", "text": "他沉醉于喜悦之中。", "shortMeaning": "他满心欢喜，醉在里头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62752c10-2533-41ac-a538-f54a7ce25021", "text": "他没听见有人叫他的名字。", "shortMeaning": "有人喊他名字，他没听见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd8cf524-8981-4ae4-b845-071d1e1561f5", "text": "他没带钥匙，用铁丝拨动了两下，门居然开了。", "shortMeaning": "他没带钥匙，拿铁丝拨了两下，门竟开了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bdcbbaa4-906f-40b9-a4e8-6c4a7a8f837d", "text": "他没帮助我的话，我就失败了。", "shortMeaning": "要不是他帮，我就败了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4cdb126e-a73e-4736-ac08-81f39e1ed925", "text": "他没有举起他的手。", "shortMeaning": "他没有把手抬起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc25c671-99e1-432a-8216-0136206444db", "text": "他没有他看上去的那么蠢。", "shortMeaning": "他没看着那么笨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:195989d0-fdf3-4fd5-80e6-be5450e09fb3", "text": "他没有任何幽默感。", "shortMeaning": "他一点都不懂风趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8eafea2-72d9-4541-ac09-17e13fc23923", "text": "他没有出去，而是坐下了。", "shortMeaning": "他没往外走，反倒坐了下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79d4d29b-cd29-48e9-8660-eb7eca1b2ca5", "text": "他没有去，换句话说，他去的这个事实无案可查。", "shortMeaning": "他没去，也就是他到场这事查不到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c5116f7-fe62-45a9-9951-3df8ee78821d", "text": "他没有接电话，所以我给他发了封邮件。", "shortMeaning": "他没接电话，我便给他发了电邮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe62b560-6331-410b-93e0-d75b601e45ae", "text": "他没有牺牲生命，也没有出卖组织。", "shortMeaning": "他既没舍命，也没出卖组织。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40ac2e6b-9694-4159-9edb-51e5043aa9fd", "text": "他没有留下痕迹就消失了。", "shortMeaning": "他走得没留下一点痕迹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ccbf47b0-bce6-4f67-b4c1-10d9ad369d02", "text": "他没有能力买新车。", "shortMeaning": "新车子他是买不起的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6fb7870-dd47-47cd-81a4-b3738682baa0", "text": "他没有能力去管理那个团队。", "shortMeaning": "那个团队他管不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c431c7b3-2ec5-40b4-930c-4b2d2f922023", "text": "他没有解释他为什么缺席了。", "shortMeaning": "他为什么没来，他没说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05e8f872-3295-47fd-8aec-f0cc0a9d8c12", "text": "他没有进步的迹象。", "shortMeaning": "看不出他有长进。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3b4bb7d-d068-4e81-bd1b-d7e0f490dd7d", "text": "他没说到关于他的那部分。", "shortMeaning": "关于他的那一段他没提。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:269d0cf9-1a22-4a29-8af5-1cda8833f3aa", "text": "他法语一句都不会说，但是英语却能说得和自己的母语一样。", "shortMeaning": "他法语一句不会，英语却跟母语一样顺。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e98aa22-20bd-4210-96fd-bd630891e4a7", "text": "他法语说得很流利。", "shortMeaning": "他法语讲得很溜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25bb6feb-6dad-4cdf-a1a8-7fe8d3f464d8", "text": "他注定再也见不到她了。", "shortMeaning": "他注定再见不着她了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d056b80-acfb-4182-88bc-2024c3de00b6", "text": "他消失了，不留一丝踪迹。", "shortMeaning": "他人不见了，寻不着影。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:865ded32-474b-4497-8a35-86d66dc674c7", "text": "他消失得无影无踪。", "shortMeaning": "他一下子没影了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c3a8d66-67e9-453a-bf6e-3f8da10d83fb", "text": "他深深地叹了口气，将手放在了门把手上。", "shortMeaning": "他长叹一声，把手搁在门把上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f51a85a4-7c72-44a3-a0b8-a2e7a6d45901", "text": "他游到不能游为止。", "shortMeaning": "他一直游到游不动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af717c14-c77a-4502-bfc5-9e49bc3c08e5", "text": "他游泳游得比我好。", "shortMeaning": "他水性比我强。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09b67803-ddee-4c6d-b885-ba7bcd9ff5f5", "text": "他滑雪时摔断了腿。", "shortMeaning": "他滑雪摔折了腿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e1920bd7-2254-4a0e-bf73-781147cf247d", "text": "他演讲时候的发音很自然。", "shortMeaning": "他讲话时咬字很自然。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12e9cc42-e776-44de-8dc2-c6e50b3030f8", "text": "他潜进水里，然后又浮上水来换气。", "shortMeaning": "他扎进水里，又浮上来换口气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a4503d1-7c51-408c-a5ce-0475943a569a", "text": "他爱好与人讨论问题。", "shortMeaning": "他喜欢跟人辩事理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ff6e316-c87a-48bc-aa62-b85ecfb87a1d", "text": "他爸爸总是很晚回家。", "shortMeaning": "他父亲总回得很晚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9cd4212-e01c-4f10-9aa1-18ea9ce390b0", "text": "他牢牢地抓住了她的手臂。", "shortMeaning": "他死死攥住她的胳膊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f61c1283-bb2c-434d-a6ea-f81453b146a3", "text": "他犯下了多项罪行。", "shortMeaning": "他犯了好几桩罪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0acb16b5-af11-406e-b477-0865691b11c9", "text": "他犯规了，因为他推倒了对方。", "shortMeaning": "他把对方推倒，犯了规。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3c00d13-4f52-4fa5-b28f-6594b4ffa215", "text": "他独占了这间宽敞的屋子。", "shortMeaning": "这间大屋子他一人占了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5af6dcbd-2b8c-4eb5-bc08-fe8d98f1bc2b", "text": "他独自环游了世界八十天。", "shortMeaning": "他一人绕地球走了八十天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29d855b9-17c3-487c-a659-d30f90be21c6", "text": "他狼吞虎咽地吃了一顿。", "shortMeaning": "他风卷残云吃了一顿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82f9ee31-3a37-4314-9b79-2427b7c618b1", "text": "他狼吞虎咽地吃了食物。", "shortMeaning": "他把东西大口大口扒了下去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c3ce676-4626-405b-80e8-7572f773c0ae", "text": "他环顾四周，没有看到任何人。", "shortMeaning": "他四下张望，一个人也没见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9037e82c-f9f5-4feb-90fe-7dc2ea8406a6", "text": "他现在已是江郎才尽。", "shortMeaning": "他如今本事使尽，才气没了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f9d605cb-b273-4c65-96f6-c7a36f2eb33e", "text": "他生来就是一个大方的人。", "shortMeaning": "他天生就大方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f65855a-5757-4f25-b727-8500ab9ddfb0", "text": "他生来就是个艺术家。", "shortMeaning": "他天生成的艺术家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ede4a05-fc78-48b4-bcaa-7f9ce762a934", "text": "他用30天横渡了太平洋。", "shortMeaning": "他花了三十天横渡太平洋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:75556f0d-d916-42d8-a252-c938e8a5dc74", "text": "他用一块木头刻出一尊佛像。", "shortMeaning": "他拿一块木头雕了尊佛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b7e9706-6e6b-458d-8556-1725120f57fd", "text": "他用不正确的方式作了回答。", "shortMeaning": "他答得不对路。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a15061e7-e49c-4d58-a539-651e76bd868e", "text": "他用不着起这么早。", "shortMeaning": "他不必起这么早。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:252a9b72-2f31-4b40-ab04-a433be15dec1", "text": "他用他的迪吉里杜管勾引了她。", "shortMeaning": "他用迪吉里杜管这种长管乐器引住了她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76e7aadc-15d2-4281-ad81-41cbd98d7e54", "text": "他用他的魔术给我留下深刻印象。", "shortMeaning": "他的戏法让我记得很牢。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:686d7b98-b3dd-40c2-a1ab-f45a5d62bbdd", "text": "他用手撑着下巴，听着。", "shortMeaning": "他托着下巴听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c33239b-6ff8-4f9a-a260-c66940638bc9", "text": "他用毛巾弄干自己。", "shortMeaning": "他拿毛巾把身子擦干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c114f1f3-2700-4741-ac14-b647b499daeb", "text": "他用水装满了瓶子。", "shortMeaning": "他把瓶子灌上了水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c891e03-df3d-4750-ae48-95e4d303186c", "text": "他用绷带包扎了伤口。", "shortMeaning": "他拿绷带把伤口裹上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:faa61a64-d640-4128-b8f2-1b2d4d10bcf2", "text": "他用胶合剂填满了裂缝。", "shortMeaning": "他用胶把裂缝填上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d60168ef-28ad-42ac-b38b-692f691cdb1a", "text": "他用虚假的诺言欺骗了他。", "shortMeaning": "他拿空话哄了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68f8b06a-f139-455f-a2a5-ed5bc493cc72", "text": "他用蜂蜜来代替糖。", "shortMeaning": "他拿蜂蜜顶糖用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e1af70e-1664-4390-9048-7dcb417d2c64", "text": "他留了胡子，为了让自己看起来更成熟。", "shortMeaning": "他蓄起胡子，好显得老成些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7a2c2331-ea61-4a13-bf2a-651e961a4518", "text": "他留在那儿不到四天。", "shortMeaning": "他在那儿待了不满四天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4dc0dd68-c518-4f49-b3cd-8c66c4054e62", "text": "他病了，所以脸色显得苍白。", "shortMeaning": "他病着，脸上没血色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe0ac999-b451-4d11-b748-bd88f1a7c6bc", "text": "他白天睡觉，晚上工作。", "shortMeaning": "他白天睡，夜里干活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d786954-3857-4a9f-b8d5-a293b0cb4dcd", "text": "他的专业是经济学。", "shortMeaning": "他学的是经济学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77a0504f-21f4-4c5c-8f46-c2a48a35680e", "text": "他的主意不足挂齿。", "shortMeaning": "他那些主意不值一提。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9495081b-1b85-4bce-8bb9-811adf0d43ea", "text": "他的主意总是可行的。", "shortMeaning": "他的办法总能办得成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:423fbaa4-f554-41b1-b524-03a892be2f1a", "text": "他的书仅仅一月前出版了，且已经卖了一千册。", "shortMeaning": "他的书一个月前才出，已卖了一千本。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:680114b5-4f4f-4dc0-85b5-412dda7420cc", "text": "他的书和他父亲的一样多。", "shortMeaning": "他藏书数目跟父亲持平。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c709943-0012-449a-8675-67e4a84634f2", "text": "他的人生充满了起起落落。", "shortMeaning": "他这辈子起伏很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45204dc8-2baf-4246-add5-41cd6a16b83c", "text": "他的体形生得很匀称！肩膀宽，腰身窄，肚子又没凸出来。", "shortMeaning": "他身架匀称：肩宽、腰细、肚子不凸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac3c2f05-6412-4948-8533-b31ea022d868", "text": "他的体重超过80公斤。", "shortMeaning": "他体重过了八十公斤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ec499cb-0f02-4bc7-bcf9-f96edd1fa022", "text": "他的兴趣爱好是收集旧邮票。", "shortMeaning": "他爱攒旧邮票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f9d2716e-bf6c-4733-b111-8f880057123c", "text": "他的办公室里不挂字，不挂画，挂了一副世界地图。", "shortMeaning": "他办公室不挂字画，只挂一张世界地图。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1a243ef-6eec-442a-a522-ad9adbdbb047", "text": "他的努力没有成果。", "shortMeaning": "他费了力，却没收成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48ff2fba-a03c-45f7-9405-fd9c8bfe95d1", "text": "他的勇气将帮助他度过这艰难的任务。", "shortMeaning": "凭这份胆气他能熬过这件难事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ea98674-1040-4756-8e12-1cdcce34f6d2", "text": "他的医生建议他戒烟。", "shortMeaning": "大夫劝他把烟戒了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0db09ead-6b1d-4a34-8573-6d67d069916a", "text": "他的去世让他的太太大受打击。", "shortMeaning": "他一走，他太太受了大打击。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b02792cd-748c-4f2f-92da-832e0d18098d", "text": "他的发音远非完美。", "shortMeaning": "他的咬字算不上好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16498375-4a5b-4d2c-8b37-a917672e3ade", "text": "他的叔叔五年前去世了。", "shortMeaning": "他叔叔五年前过世。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46bd5429-4548-4f31-8634-c2cbac42d288", "text": "他的口音显露出他是外国人。", "shortMeaning": "听他的腔调就知道他是外国人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16a49cd0-9532-4e2f-b824-00b5ea5ac90d", "text": "他的名字不在名单里。", "shortMeaning": "名单上没有他的名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49b24abb-142f-4ee0-b878-cbaf6e96d395", "text": "他的名字在这个地区人尽皆知。", "shortMeaning": "这一带没人不知道他的名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9cbb6bb4-5143-4fd9-8163-42563b1cc828", "text": "他的哥哥学习很认真。", "shortMeaning": "他哥哥念书很上心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69f364b2-e1ff-41b0-a0f1-04d0cc8de2e4", "text": "他的哥哥很认真学习。", "shortMeaning": "他哥哥读书格外用心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71235606-2186-4654-93a2-f7f4a520787f", "text": "他的回应出乎我们的意料。", "shortMeaning": "他的答话叫我们意外。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf8815e4-c4fa-4adf-ae14-a4fe429689bf", "text": "他的回答其实是拒绝。", "shortMeaning": "他答的话其实是回绝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8037fd50-7ab5-42fd-893e-1a9d2d0a5ecf", "text": "他的声音听着很舒服。", "shortMeaning": "他的嗓子听着顺耳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a45a834-4d49-44bb-ad9b-edbf4c6fa4e0", "text": "他的外语文笔也很成熟。", "shortMeaning": "他用外文写东西也很老到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4654de37-bbef-44e3-90ea-0865c37dc7ef", "text": "他的大部分收入付了租金。", "shortMeaning": "他的钱大半交了房租。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8bee7693-c7cc-4f1d-b10a-a5a46e934543", "text": "他的失败好似和他的性格有什么关系。", "shortMeaning": "他栽跟头，似乎跟性子有关。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:60669fb9-01bf-417d-9b72-f593cdba775b", "text": "他的失败是显而易见的。", "shortMeaning": "他败得很明白。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:710ada9a-0d3f-492b-985d-907e1e019670", "text": "他的失败看来有几个原因。", "shortMeaning": "他败，看来有几个缘故。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e17bd97-db5f-47eb-b616-48e3396a2db1", "text": "他的头撞倒了一块岩石。", "shortMeaning": "他的头撞上了一块石头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49793d1c-a6f4-46c1-a784-3b0da39e4167", "text": "他的威信日渐衰落。", "shortMeaning": "他的声望一天不如一天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96e0807b-4529-4b53-818f-af6a1fb1999b", "text": "他的字典里没有勤奋这个词。", "shortMeaning": "他这人从来不知用功。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e6940d80-8263-4946-9b28-d483b9bc7f2e", "text": "他的实验用了鸽子。", "shortMeaning": "他做实验用的是鸽子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b93f1fc-360f-46c2-acb4-fe8d33d01692", "text": "他的家不幸有人身亡。", "shortMeaning": "他家不幸死了人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5ba864f-dfba-4159-94b7-a301973d123d", "text": "他的家每周彻底打扫一次。", "shortMeaning": "他家一星期大扫除一回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce0bb144-9c8a-4f65-a763-29391e1eb927", "text": "他的容貌改变了许多。", "shortMeaning": "他的相貌变了不少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff898d2e-a5d2-4227-b376-f1b1fac8e170", "text": "他的工作工资很高，工作时间也相当理想。", "shortMeaning": "他这份活工钱高，钟点也合意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dfcd127e-868d-4ee1-a53b-727b61c7e994", "text": "他的工资是我的两倍。", "shortMeaning": "他的工钱有我两倍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a7c0390-59d0-40ef-acd0-05f4df314818", "text": "他的工资被削减到最低程度。", "shortMeaning": "他的工钱给压到了最低。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f7538a41-2c98-4407-9a3b-2358c3d6b61d", "text": "他的左手被刀割伤了。", "shortMeaning": "他左手被刀划伤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f739dc2c-9f61-45bd-90e8-8f20dd3317cc", "text": "他的希望渐渐破灭了。", "shortMeaning": "他的指望一点点没了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73ff4dad-9022-437c-85f2-7a1281015d44", "text": "他的年收入比他兄弟多。", "shortMeaning": "他一年挣的比兄弟多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7573c301-d989-4d08-8e5e-2eadd8700240", "text": "他的年龄是她的两倍。", "shortMeaning": "他岁数有她两倍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1157c306-1793-471b-8b47-f244146c5f0a", "text": "他的弟弟学习很认真。", "shortMeaning": "他弟弟念书很用功。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:184ba8b5-dc4d-464b-a111-6313ca0e66bf", "text": "他的忠告总是很明智。", "shortMeaning": "他的劝告总是很在理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cdd2d539-1f3f-49da-8074-67f95f82db7a", "text": "他的忠告没起到太大的作用。", "shortMeaning": "他的劝话没大起作用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2b1950f-a2a6-4584-b25f-27aec40fd9ec", "text": "他的思考方法有点极端。", "shortMeaning": "他想事的路子有点偏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b1e9a5bf-ed31-45ed-bd3a-46fd0029a477", "text": "他的急脾气迟早会惹祸上身。", "shortMeaning": "他这急脾气早晚招祸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:801d2dab-4a96-46b4-b17e-73c7c91d60c3", "text": "他的想法完全没有价值。", "shortMeaning": "他那些念头一文不值。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c54f385-707d-4391-b333-485e6602e2e6", "text": "他的意见跟我的不一致。", "shortMeaning": "他的意思跟我的对不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f0c1059-e56f-4722-818b-54626b3e9413", "text": "他的愿望最终实现了。", "shortMeaning": "他的心愿最后成了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6f084ebc-8c86-4886-badc-a256c470fdf6", "text": "他的懒惰是他未来不好的预兆。", "shortMeaning": "他这么懒，往后的日子不妙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83c5602d-ec1d-4681-ae52-34ecc06483b8", "text": "他的成功是必然的。", "shortMeaning": "他成事是跑不了的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49fbd55b-96a8-4959-91d4-fa0337d53fa1", "text": "他的房子卖了1万美元。", "shortMeaning": "他的房子卖了一万美元。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e8e7f10-2b31-421b-8822-ef4218e42694", "text": "他的房子又小又旧。", "shortMeaning": "他的屋子又小又破。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79a1e8fa-f0b9-4c5e-b599-cdf2a963cd6c", "text": "他的房间一片狼藉。", "shortMeaning": "他屋里乱成一团。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c299f2ce-1f82-4df8-99fd-9fc67b8ab2f4", "text": "他的房间乱七八糟。", "shortMeaning": "他房里东西扔得到处都是。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae591e50-5181-4ecf-af99-dd3c3d96d985", "text": "他的房间总是那么整洁干净。", "shortMeaning": "他的屋子总那么干净齐整。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ba53f41-e488-4760-859a-beefc8b3ed38", "text": "他的所有句子都很短。", "shortMeaning": "他说的句子都很短。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7d02df5-bed6-4f2d-9ff3-6aa713fff251", "text": "他的所有家庭成员都很高。", "shortMeaning": "他家个个都高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:652d636f-a569-47f0-9b5b-b81f45dd5cde", "text": "他的援助真是雪中送炭。", "shortMeaning": "他这一帮，真是雪里送炭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e35ce6d-0beb-473e-aca2-fbf279be8dd8", "text": "他的收入比我多三倍。", "shortMeaning": "他挣的钱比我多三倍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0acf68af-7e36-491d-b20f-1a6f32340b8c", "text": "他的政权必定会崩溃。", "shortMeaning": "他那一摊政权必定垮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c170dc7-70bf-4800-acea-9c4710ee0634", "text": "他的政治生涯完蛋了。", "shortMeaning": "他的政治路子断了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4514a59f-5988-480e-bb33-cb4bfb60166f", "text": "他的故事一部分是真的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的有一半是真的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c54f843-2d9c-40a8-bff0-8182bcc258b9", "text": "他的故事不会是假的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的不会是假的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bdbeb496-cff0-4f7a-8512-0e6bb0a3d7a1", "text": "他的故事不可能是假的。", "shortMeaning": "他那话绝不可能是编的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7e152b6-067b-4777-90f7-b3a727d9200c", "text": "他的故事不可能是真的。", "shortMeaning": "他那话绝不可能是真事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:90262218-17e4-4c7e-83f2-647721a32e8a", "text": "他的故事就是简单。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的事本来就简单。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:382ad5eb-b6c4-4060-9d16-27c77118e8a7", "text": "他的故事很有意思。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的事挺有趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4168c966-14ac-4f88-8056-334a20f05c48", "text": "他的故事把大家给逗乐了。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的故事把大伙逗笑了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8497d7fc-6981-4759-9065-5fc97b91e089", "text": "他的故事是真的吗？", "shortMeaning": "他讲的这事是真的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9fe38c36-4e56-40c9-b3dc-c1dcc9dcdb91", "text": "他的故事肯定是真的。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的准是真的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbe07f6b-084b-47cc-b269-4a2375e82cac", "text": "他的新小说什么时候出版？", "shortMeaning": "他那本新小说几时出？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:311cd829-9cb1-45d2-b1b5-9e8e0911ed34", "text": "他的新电影很无聊。", "shortMeaning": "他新拍的片子很乏味。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b8b933e-decc-4243-9573-5066aa17bb47", "text": "他的日常行为并不和他的原则相一致。", "shortMeaning": "他平日做的跟他的原则对不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0cffe76f-9e7c-4cb7-a04b-5c05c841a501", "text": "他的村屋在海岸上。", "shortMeaning": "他村里那房子在海边上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b417011-7213-4bf2-89e2-a2eb5aa44637", "text": "他的样子就是说一套做一套。", "shortMeaning": "他这人嘴上说一套，做又一套。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f990945-2d7e-4496-9c52-d39d08d53626", "text": "他的梦想是去瑞士。", "shortMeaning": "他盼着去瑞士。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:413b5546-e045-434a-92ae-b6a76439dcf4", "text": "他的梦想是成为航天航空工程师。", "shortMeaning": "他想当航空航天的工程师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8a3cf7de-f387-4088-9d01-e81b763ca24b", "text": "他的梦想最终实现了。", "shortMeaning": "他的梦想到底成了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cebccf4e-6d76-44b3-8240-f274ca4114b5", "text": "他的梦想终于实现了。", "shortMeaning": "他那个梦想到头来真成了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46d9dcd2-8275-45a2-bd22-f7044fec05b1", "text": "他的棒球生涯到此结束。", "shortMeaning": "他的棒球路子到此为止。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dc24556a-4e7f-4602-bf7c-1d4717353d8e", "text": "他的武功已经达到了出神入化的境界。", "shortMeaning": "他的武艺已到了化境。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:665de16a-5596-4040-89d8-caca08ab3b49", "text": "他的每日目标是什么？", "shortMeaning": "他每天要办成什么事？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dfd31b70-6cfe-4b89-b299-606e0d706690", "text": "他的演唱会值得一听。", "shortMeaning": "他的演唱会值得去听一场。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc133bf0-6687-4834-850d-6f5e3debf3c3", "text": "他的演技绝对有瑕疵。", "shortMeaning": "他的演技肯定有毛病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c26f5767-3160-470b-b1d7-543f39adbc5a", "text": "他的演讲深深地打动了公众。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的话深深打动了众人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4311ca0a-fb44-4958-8499-89eb7363a87d", "text": "他的演讲简短且切中要害。", "shortMeaning": "他讲得短，句句在点上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1be57092-c369-4ae5-bb30-dbba8da73227", "text": "他的演说打动了我们。", "shortMeaning": "他的话把我们都打动了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f26ab6c-7a7f-451b-a46e-7fd2227c218f", "text": "他的爱好是画有花的图。", "shortMeaning": "他喜欢画带花的画。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b3dc91b-35e4-4666-9f00-49181f03c009", "text": "他的父母经营一家酒店。", "shortMeaning": "他父母开着一家旅店。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9bdeee12-8a97-4982-a853-aca2479d167c", "text": "他的牙齿白得像珍珠一样。", "shortMeaning": "他的牙白得像珍珠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:586d1f3f-ca80-4cf3-afea-2206020efbf1", "text": "他的牙齿被烟熏黄了。", "shortMeaning": "他抽烟把牙熏黄了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d75d949d-fac5-40f6-8720-d772c5e8d41f", "text": "他的物理学得很好。", "shortMeaning": "他物理念得好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3372fd15-4af3-4478-9973-011c8d1e7e9d", "text": "他的玩具是蓝色的。", "shortMeaning": "他的玩具是蓝的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82a17c96-203a-4a61-9329-0ddc0e3f16c8", "text": "他的玩笑他有意思了。", "shortMeaning": "他开的玩笑真有意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d3c47e7-0114-4b7d-a11e-1514dc13028b", "text": "他的生命受到了威胁。", "shortMeaning": "他的性命有了危险。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4f2feb4-5894-4f26-b8e5-5286afa2abc5", "text": "他的生日是八月二十一日。", "shortMeaning": "他八月二十一日过生日。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d4f02ab-2bd8-4b8c-8f78-fc1c951eb0ee", "text": "他的生活只有一个目的，那就是赚钱。", "shortMeaning": "他活着只为一样：挣钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f960379-3797-417b-a6bb-557345e619c9", "text": "他的画被悬挂在墙上。", "shortMeaning": "他的画挂到了墙上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d24d97a-2ca4-4f6c-b3df-5f57b46bac4e", "text": "他的病是她的忧虑之一。", "shortMeaning": "他的病是她操心的事之一。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23162f18-e157-4aa2-a7e9-b5ec94295a6c", "text": "他的痛苦现在已经过去。", "shortMeaning": "他那份苦如今过去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f12b440c-6d86-441b-aa6f-e76a3569c074", "text": "他的瘫痪正在恶化，不久他就不能下床了。", "shortMeaning": "他的瘫症越来越重，很快就要起不来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d8a6cf2-7e8a-496f-a58b-68bba81e684f", "text": "他的直播间被封禁了。", "shortMeaning": "他的直播间给封了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e8884ee-619d-409b-89ea-56c164b80830", "text": "他的看法真是一文不值。", "shortMeaning": "他的想法分文不值。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c62fd96-f2df-49c7-b987-ca38c9b1f613", "text": "他的眼睛掩饰不了内心的恐慌。", "shortMeaning": "他眼里的慌藏不住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
